From ed090530a56720a6c57fa8dd537298eaa6bd825a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Keith Packard <keithp@keithp.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 08:13:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 13/15] test-posix: Check the special values and errors of
 remquo and others

For double, float and long double, in each rounding mode: remquo's
quotient bits and domain errors, frexp, modf, scalbln and scalbn,
logb's pole and ilogb's domain errors,
nan, copysign, log1p's pole and domain errors, atan, erfc, the
rounding functions' signs and nearbyint's inexact flag, and fmax and
fmin with NaN arguments.

Signed-off-by: Keith Packard <keithp@keithp.com>
---
